WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue() {
  font-family: Arial;
}

00:38:56.160 --> 00:38:57.360 line:95%,end
(SNEEZES)
(YELPS)

00:39:00.120 --> 00:39:02.520 line:95%,end
Oh, my God!
(GIGGLING)

00:39:04.240 --> 00:39:05.800 line:95%,end
(PHONE RINGING)

00:39:07.800 --> 00:39:09.200 line:95%,end
Hello?
HELEN: <i>Hey, honey.</i>

00:39:09.360 --> 00:39:11.120 line:95%,end
You weren't gonna call me?
BOB: <i>Oh, hey!</i>

00:39:11.280 --> 00:39:13.320 line:95%,end
(STAMMERING)
No. I mean, yes, yeah...

00:39:13.480 --> 00:39:15.680 line:95%,end
I just didn't
wanna wake you.
(JACK-JACK BABBLING)

00:39:15.840 --> 00:39:18.560 line:95%,end
The strangest thing
just happened
out in the yard.

00:39:18.720 --> 00:39:19.840 line:95%,end
Sounds like I just
woke you up.

00:39:19.920 --> 00:39:20.960 line:95%,end
<i>No, no.</i>

00:39:21.040 --> 00:39:22.800 line:95%,end
It's just, Jack-Jack...
<i>He had an accident!</i>

00:39:23.000 --> 00:39:24.200 line:95%,end
I knew it!

00:39:24.280 --> 00:39:25.760 line:95%,end
I'm coming home right now!
I never should have...

00:39:25.960 --> 00:39:28.360 line:95%,end
No accident. Stay there
and finish your mission.

00:39:28.520 --> 00:39:29.880 line:95%,end
You never should...

00:39:30.040 --> 00:39:32.000 line:95%,end
What? You don't think
I can do this?

00:39:32.160 --> 00:39:34.560 line:95%,end
No, no.
Sorry. I misspoke.

00:39:34.720 --> 00:39:35.960 line:95%,end
Do you need me
to come back?

00:39:36.120 --> 00:39:38.920 line:95%,end
No, no. No, I've got this.
Everything's great.

00:39:39.080 --> 00:39:40.480 line:95%,end
What happened
with Jack-Jack?

00:39:41.960 --> 00:39:44.160 line:95%,end
Nothing.
He's in excellent health.

00:39:44.320 --> 00:39:46.400 line:95%,end
<i>Well, that's good.</i>
(VIOLET SOBBING)

00:39:46.480 --> 00:39:48.520 line:95%,end
<i>How was Violet's date?</i>
BOB: Uh...

00:39:48.960 --> 00:39:50.480 line:95%,end
HELEN:
<i>That was tonight, right?</i>

00:39:50.640 --> 00:39:53.120 line:95%,end
BOB: (STAMMERING)
Yes. Good.

00:39:53.320 --> 00:39:55.400 line:95%,end
All fine and good.

00:39:55.560 --> 00:39:57.320 line:95%,end
And Jack-Jack went down
with no trouble?

00:39:57.480 --> 00:39:58.960 line:95%,end
(JACK-JACK COOING)
Fine, yes, no trouble.

00:39:59.160 --> 00:40:00.720 line:95%,end
And Dash got
his homework done?

00:40:00.880 --> 00:40:02.160 line:95%,end
BOB: All done.

00:40:02.320 --> 00:40:03.320 line:95%,end
So, things haven't
spiraled out

00:40:03.400 --> 00:40:04.440 line:95%,end
of control
the moment I left?

00:40:04.520 --> 00:40:06.440 line:95%,end
Amazing as it may seem,

00:40:06.520 --> 00:40:08.880 line:95%,end
it has been
quite uneventful in fact.

00:40:09.040 --> 00:40:10.520 line:95%,end
<i>How about you?</i>

00:40:10.720 --> 00:40:13.320 line:95%,end
I saved a runaway train!
(LAUGHING IN DELIGHT)

00:40:14.880 --> 00:40:16.560 line:95%,end
<i>It was so great!</i>

00:40:16.720 --> 00:40:18.480 line:95%,end
The mayor was there to cut
the ribbon on this new train.

00:40:19.360 --> 00:40:20.960 line:95%,end
REPORTER 1:
<i>Elastigirl pursued the train</i>

00:40:21.040 --> 00:40:23.120 line:95%,end
<i>and was able</i>
<i>to successfully activate...</i>

00:40:23.280 --> 00:40:25.360 line:95%,end
Blah, blah, blah.
He says a few words,
cuts the ribbon...

00:40:25.520 --> 00:40:26.640 line:95%,end
and the train starts pulling

00:40:26.720 --> 00:40:28.120 line:95%,end
out of the station
backwards...

00:40:28.320 --> 00:40:30.000 line:95%,end
REPORTER 2: <i>...track of</i>
<i>its brand new hovertrain...</i>

00:40:30.080 --> 00:40:31.560 line:95%,end
<i>...malfunctioned...</i>

00:40:31.720 --> 00:40:32.800 line:95%,end
<i>...thanking Elastigirl...</i>

00:40:34.400 --> 00:40:35.440 line:95%,end
REPORTER 3:
<i>Superhero Elastigirl...</i>

00:40:35.520 --> 00:40:36.560 line:95%,end
REPORTER 4: <i>Elastigirl...</i>

00:40:36.720 --> 00:40:40.080 line:95%,end
Boom! No casualties!
(SQUEALS)

00:40:40.160 --> 00:40:41.520 line:95%,end
REPORTER 5:
<i>...specialized motorbike,</i>

00:40:41.600 --> 00:40:42.760 line:95%,end
<i>saving all of</i>
<i>the passengers...</i>

00:40:42.960 --> 00:40:44.040 line:95%,end
HELEN:<i> One thing</i>
<i>leads to another</i>

00:40:44.120 --> 00:40:45.120 line:95%,end
<i>and suddenly,</i>
<i>I go after it!</i>

00:40:45.280 --> 00:40:47.440 line:95%,end
<i>I'm telling you, honey,</i>
<i>it was a saga!</i>

00:40:47.600 --> 00:40:49.400 line:95%,end
That's fantastic, honey!

00:40:49.560 --> 00:40:51.680 line:95%,end
And on your first night!

00:40:51.880 --> 00:40:54.760 line:95%,end
I am so proud of you, really.

00:40:54.920 --> 00:40:56.400 line:95%,end
<i>I'm proud of you, honey.</i>

00:40:56.560 --> 00:40:59.080 line:95%,end
I know you want
to get out there
and you will soon.

00:40:59.240 --> 00:41:01.040 line:95%,end
And you'll be amazing.

00:41:01.200 --> 00:41:02.320 line:95%,end
I couldn't have done this

00:41:02.400 --> 00:41:03.760 line:95%,end
if you hadn't
taken over so well.

00:41:03.920 --> 00:41:05.560 line:95%,end
<i>Thanks for handling</i>
<i>everything.</i>

00:41:05.720 --> 00:41:07.160 line:95%,end
It's nothing.

00:41:07.360 --> 00:41:10.360 line:95%,end
(SIGHS) I love you, honey.
I'll be back soon.

00:41:10.520 --> 00:41:13.200 line:95%,end
<i>Sweet dreams.</i>
Sweet dreams, honey.

00:41:14.160 --> 00:41:15.440 line:95%,end
(SIGHS)

00:41:16.600 --> 00:41:17.960 line:95%,end
(SNORING)

00:41:28.240 --> 00:41:29.600 line:95%,end
(BOB MUMBLING)

00:41:29.680 --> 00:41:32.440 line:95%,end
(IMITATES DASH)
"Hey, Dad, it's okay.

00:41:32.520 --> 00:41:34.320 line:95%,end
"I'll just wait for Mom
to get home."

00:41:35.200 --> 00:41:37.920 line:95%,end
As if she could...
I know how to...

00:41:38.840 --> 00:41:40.200 line:95%,end
I can do math.

00:41:45.960 --> 00:41:47.240 line:95%,end
(GROANS)

00:41:50.160 --> 00:41:52.520 line:95%,end
Oh, brother...
(MUMBLING)

00:41:55.200 --> 00:41:56.800 line:95%,end
(IMITATES DASH)
Wait for Mom!

00:41:58.360 --> 00:42:00.520 line:95%,end
What am I,
a substitute parent?

00:42:03.320 --> 00:42:05.200 line:95%,end
It's not my fault
they changed math.

00:42:13.920 --> 00:42:16.240 line:95%,end
Come on, buddy.
Come on.

00:42:16.400 --> 00:42:18.960 line:95%,end
I think I understand
your math assignment.

00:42:19.120 --> 00:42:22.680 line:95%,end
We still have some time
to finish it before your test.

00:42:22.840 --> 00:42:24.720 line:95%,end
So first, you wanna put
all the numbers

00:42:24.800 --> 00:42:26.560 line:95%,end
by themselves on one side.

00:42:26.760 --> 00:42:28.600 line:95%,end
...you change the sign.

00:42:28.760 --> 00:42:31.400 line:95%,end
That means a plus becomes
a minus and a minus...

00:42:31.560 --> 00:42:32.840 line:95%,end
You got it?

00:42:33.000 --> 00:42:34.400 line:95%,end
Yeah, baby!

